0..74 Comment "// A rule that reads an introduced cell\'s value on the face it is fixed on"
75..152 Comment "// violates the boundary its `ext` member generates: the boundary law and the"
153..229 Comment "// rule rewrite one term to `zero` and to a variable, no rule the path order"
230..299 Comment "// orients joins them, and the block\'s rules are refused by name. The"
300..376 Comment "// extension type of `../../model/extension/generated.gandr` reads `zero` at"
377..403 Comment "// the face of every cell."
